      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "FE35EED32F281E40",
      "text": "歡迎光臨錦匯道館！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "FE35F1D32F282359",
      "text": "請讓我登記\\n挑戰者的名字……\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，對吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "FE35F0D32F2821A6",
      "text": "想和本道館的館主青木對戰，\\n就必須先通過道館測驗。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "FE35F3D32F2826BF",
      "text": "錦匯道館的\\n道館測驗是……\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]點一道秘密菜單[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "FE35F2D32F28250C",
      "text": "及格條件是在錦匯鎮的\\n超人氣餐館[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]寶食堂[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]，\\r\\n點出他們的秘密菜單。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "FE35F5D32F282A25",
      "text": "目前除了[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳之外，\\n在這個鎮上還有３位\\r\\n道館測驗的挑戰者。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "FE35F4D32F282872",
      "text": "參加的每位都分別知道一個\\n關於秘密菜單的提示。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "FE35F7D32F282D8B",
      "text": "請去與其他挑戰者互相寶可夢對戰，\\n並由輸的一方告訴贏的一方\\r\\n自己擁有的那個提示。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "FE35F6D32F282BD8",
      "text": "最後根據收集到的提示，\\n向寶食堂的店員\\r\\n點這道秘密菜單。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "FE3289D32F253CCA",
      "text": "成功點菜的那一位挑戰者，\\n就是道館測驗的及格者了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_11",
      "hash64": "FE328AD32F253E7D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的提示是\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]常客的吃法[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_12",
      "hash64": "FE3287D32F253964",
      "text": "也許可以去向\\n寶食堂的常客打聽一下喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
